{\b Try ArrowKeys}
\par Open ArrowKeys in Applications and allow it in Privacy & Security > Accessibility. Hold Option to navigate. A Caps Lock key already assigned to Option works too. For automatic startup, select Open at Login in the ArrowKeys menu. When upgrading from the Karabiner edition, remove the old ArrowKeys rule in Complex Modifications.
}
